<s>\begin{slide}


Diagram the flow of control between the OS and the three tasks:

\begin{itemize}
\item The three tasks are labeled A, B, C
\item When priorities are used, they are such that B $>$ A $>$ C.
\item The nature of the three tasks is as follows:
    \begin{description}
      \item [A]  Run for 2ms and then call the OS to do I/O which
      lasts for 1.667 ms.  Return to Scheduler.
      \item [B]  run for 1.333ms,  Return to Scheduler.
      \item [C]  Run forever.
    \end{description}
\end{itemize}

